(tenant-filtered management flows.) Tj
T*
(- `src/modules/appointments/` implements public booking, slot availability, tenant) Tj
T*
(appointment lists, and status changes.) Tj
T*
(- `src/modules/users/` implements profile and business membership management.) Tj
T*
(- `src/modules/reviews/`, `src/modules/notifications/`, and `src/modules/audit-logs/`) Tj
T*
(implement completed-appointment reviews, private in-app notifications, and scoped change) Tj
T*
(history.) Tj
T*
(- `src/modules/dashboard/` and `src/modules/platform-admin/` provide business summaries and) Tj
T*
(restricted platform operations.) Tj
T*
(- `src/database/` contains the Prisma client setup and transaction helper. Prisma models and) Tj
T*
(migrations cover users, businesses, memberships, services, staff, weekly schedules,) Tj
T*
(appointments, reviews, notifications, and audit logs.) Tj
T*
(- `src/lib/`, `src/jobs/`, and `src/realtime/` hold placeholders for logging, Redis/BullMQ) Tj
T*
(jobs, and Socket.IO.) Tj
T*
(- `tests/` contains the health endpoint test. `docs/` describes architecture, API) Tj
T*
(conventions, and tenancy guidance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(What is not built yet) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Password reset, email verification, refresh tokens, and session revocation are not) Tj
T*
(implemented. Redis, BullMQ, and Socket.IO are not connected yet; notifications are stored in) Tj
T*
(the app database and are not sent by email or push.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Tenant design) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The design uses one shared PostgreSQL database. The current tenant middleware checks an) Tj
T*
(authenticated user's membership and active business status before attaching `req.tenant`. It) Tj
T*
(accepts `X-Business-Id` for users with multiple memberships. Tenant-owned models carry) Tj
T*
(`businessId`, and feature repositories filter queries by that verified ID.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Run it locally) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Requires Node.js 22 or newer. From the project folder:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Run `npm install`.) Tj
T*
(2. Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and set `DATABASE_URL` and a private `JWT_ACCESS_SECRET`.) Tj
T*
(3. Apply the initial migration with `npm run prisma:deploy`.) Tj
T*
(4. Run `npm run dev`.) Tj
T*
(5. Open `http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health` or call the auth routes with an API client.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(PostgreSQL must be running for registration, login, profile, and business routes. Redis is) Tj
T*
(only a configuration value for now; the app does not connect to it yet.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Suggested build order) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Add password reset and email verification.) Tj
T*
(2. Connect realtime updates and outbound email notifications.) Tj
T*
(3. Add background jobs for reminders and other delayed work.) Tj
T*
() Tj
